  "historyNote": "#7939, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9979, INTERIM, eff 8-23-11, EXPIRES: 2-21-12; ss by #10088, eff 2-21-12; ss by #13401, eff 7-1-22; amd by #14095, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-9-24; ss by #14222, eff 3-27-25, EXPIRES: 3-27-35",
